summary:
  A heal candidate whose playlist was still unwrapping starts although the
  order ended meanwhile.

history:
  The lookup's own callbacks asked whether the listener still wanted the
  station; the audition's playlist callback asked only for the generation and
  the deadline. A row deleted in those few seconds started playing when the
  playlist answered, the same hole the retry road had until 2026-11-03.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
              // The row can be deleted, or the order end, while a .pls unwraps.
              if (!_recoveryWanted() || isPlaying() || _orderSubject() === null) return;

replace:
              // The row can be deleted, or the order end, while a .pls unwraps.
              if (false) return;

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_kin_rung_runs_before_a_stranger_auditions_and_only_once.
  Line-neutral.
